    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a relief to hear. since they've basically been operating on stolen ground for so long, i'm worried they'll try to settle quickly and quietly to sweep this under the rug before the public finds out. if i want to make sure they realize i'm not just looking for a quick payout, but that i actually want the recognition and control the contracts dictate, what kind of specific terminology or \"threats\" regarding their corporate structure should i include in my initial contact?",
